<div dir="ltr" style="text-align:start"><span style="font-size:16px;"><font color="#444444" face="Times New Roman, Times New Roman, Times, serif"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Hi&nbsp;</span></font>{{{Recipient.FirstName}}}<br />
<br />
<span style="color:#222222"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif"><span style="color:#222222"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="color:#444444">My name is Wileen and I am reaching out from the State Farm team at EverQuote. I did want to reach out to see what your plans were for Auto and Home and how EverQuote would be able to help achieve those goals.</span><br style="box-sizing:border-box; color:#444444; font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size:13px" />
<br style="box-sizing:border-box; color:#444444; font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size:13px" />
<span style="color:#444444">Based on the State Farm scorecard, State Farm agents have consistently averaged the highest close rate at EverQuote than with other vendors - this does already create a higher than normal demand which will most likely increase further with the recent subsidy news.&nbsp;</span><br style="box-sizing:border-box; color:#444444; font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size:13px" />
<br style="box-sizing:border-box; color:#444444; font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size:13px" />
<font color="#444444">If you have any questions or would like further&nbsp;clarification, feel free to reach out to me at my direct line or book some time with me on my calendar below for a day that works best for you.&nbsp;</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
&nbsp;
